 "remarks": "PLEASE NOTE: HIGHEST AND BEST BY MONDAY. MAY 4th BY 3:00 pm.  Beautiful refreshed and move in ready. This 2 bedroom, 2 full bathroom condo offers a bright, welcoming and spacious interior for easy living. Every wall has been freshly painted and brand new carpet has been installed throughout the entire second level and loft area. The living room and dining area have warm hardwood floors, a cozy fireplace and a sliding door leading out to a private deck overlooking a peaceful river setting. The perfect place to unwind in the evening. Upstairs, you will find two generously sized bedrooms, both featuring vaulted ceilings. The primary suite has two closets and a private full bath, along with access to it's own private balcony. The second bedroom has a walk in closet. A spiral staircase leads to a versatile loft space, perfect for a home office, creative studio or just a fun space to hang out. The attached garage has a new garage door and additional storage space. This is all minutes away from both 95 and the Merritt Parkway making it convenient for your commute.",
